tions\",\"unresolved\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":1,\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"slots\"],\"type\":\"object\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"original_question\":\"I'm planning a weekend getaway and want to try something creatively fulfilling. What would you suggest?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What are the user's past creative hobbies, interests, or experiences that could inform a creatively fulfilling weekend getaway?\",\"output_slot\":\"creative_history\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What are the user's past creative hobbies, interests, or experiences that could inform a creatively fulfilling weekend getaway?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"a18366c4b5e47eb95f657b50f285ae3d8d3d117cd98c5155a4d46f4478da3489\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"f02d760b91993f40bca651a3321d6b6165d5c4671b62ed1ec130f8db5703d3a7\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"ab97a5380bfa436e867deda015a077f633644de369a2a6d11d51ace2de0a9818\"},\"variables\":{\"creative_history\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"creative_history\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"creative_history\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"creative_history\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_57dffcae3d304232aa22a56d\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has a history of creative engagement with music, including remixing, composing original music, and exploring diverse genres and cultural musical traditions. They have expressed a desire to focus on original compositions and personal projects, stepping back from remixing to develop their unique artistic voice. They have also explored music through attending live performances, discovering album artwork and lyrics, and creating themed playlists. They have tried researching historical music trends but found it tedious. They have had negative experiences with collaborative music projects due to artistic disagreements, leading them to prefer independent creative work. They have also expressed a general commitment to pursuing authentic, personally fulfilling creative interests.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s27\",\"s4\",\"s28\",\"s16\",\"s36\",\"s17\",\"s38\",\"s48\",\"s37\",\"s18\",\"s46\",\"s5\",\"s19\",\"s15\",\"s7\",\"s3\",\"s47\",\"s6\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's own statements across multiple conversations establish a consistent history of creative musical activities, preferences, and experiences. They describe remixing, composing original music, exploring genres, attending live performances, and engaging with album art and lyrics. They also express a shift toward original work and independent creation, and report negative experiences with collaborative projects and historical research. These are all directly sourced from user utterances.\",\"variable\":\"creative_history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",107,413,\"User: I announced a hiatus from remixing to concentrate on original compositions and personal projects because I felt the remixes were overshadowing my own work. This decision was not made lightly, as I enjoyed the creative process of remixing and the way it allowed me to experiment with existing pieces. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",413,797,\"However, as I delved deeper into my own musical identity, I realized that I need to carve out space for my voice to shine through in original compositions. Taking this time off is about redefining my artistic vision and ensuring that my personal projects receive the attention they deserve. Ultimately, I hope to return with fresh ideas and a clearer focus on who I am as an artist.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",797,1102,\"User: I'm committing to invest my time in the creation of original music, focusing on my unique sound rather than merely reinterpreting the pieces of other artists. This decision comes from a deep-rooted desire to express my thoughts and feelings in ways that truly resonate with my personal experiences. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s6\",\"d1\",1102,1392,\"I've come to understand that original compositions allow for a more authentic exploration of my artistic vision. It's an exciting challenge for me, as I embark on this journey of self-discovery through sound and melody, ultimately aiming for a sense of fulfillment in my creative pursuits. \",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s7\",\"d1\",1392,1515,\"I hope to not only develop my skills but also share my passion with the world in a way that reflects who I am as an artist.\",\"user\",[173,174]],[\"s15\",\"d2\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s16\",\"d2\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s17\",\"d2\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s18\",\"d2\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s19\",\"d2\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s27\",\"d3\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s28\",\"d3\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s36\",\"d4\",107,341,\"User: It’s become clear to me that I need to focus on what truly inspires me and aligns more with my interests, especially recognizing how vital it is to engage with topics and activities that evoke a sense of passion and enthusiasm. \",\"user\",[107]],[\"s37\",\"d4\",341,694,\"I have realized that my time and energy are precious commodities, and they should be spent on pursuits that not only enrich my knowledge but also bring me a profound sense of fulfillment. Diving deeper into interests that resonate with my core values feels necessary, rather than stretching myself thin over activities that don't spark joy or interest. \",\"user\",[107]],[\"s38\",\"d4\",694,951,\"This realization is quite liberating, as I can see a path ahead that is clearer and more authentic to who I truly am. It makes me think about how we all deserve to chase our passions instead of conforming to what society or external pressures might dictate.\",\"user\",[107]],[\"s46\",\"d5\",107,356,\"User: After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s47\",\"d5\",356,713,\"I remember those discussions often being emotionally charged, where opinions clashed and passion ran high, but ultimately, it was clear that I couldn't contribute to something that did not resonate with my artistic essence. Feeling restricted in that environment made me question not just my contributions, but also my abilities and instincts as an artist. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s48\",\"d5\",713,896,\"This inner turmoil prompted a desire for more autonomy over my own creative endeavors, leading to a pivotal decision to explore my artistry in a more personal and independent setting.\",\"user\",[159]],[\"s53\",\"d6\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 24–25 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s54\",\"d6\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s55\",\"d6\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s56\",\"d6\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s57\",\"d6\",767,780,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s58\",\"d6\",780,1161,\"Assistant: That’s a great insight! It’s important to focus on what you love. Music is such a personal journey, and it should evoke joy rather than feelings of obligation or frustration. Understanding the theory can certainly enhance one’s appreciation, but if it detracts from the experience, it’s wise to step back. Have you tried any other forms of music exploration since then? \",\"assistant\",[25]],[\"s59\",\"d6\",1161,1499,\"There are so many avenues to experience music, whether it's attending live performances, discovering underground artists, or even engaging in creative collaborations. Each of these can rekindle your passion and allow for a fresh appreciation of the art form, helping you reconnect with what initially drew you to music in the first place.\",\"assistant\",[25]],[\"s60\",\"d7\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 70–72 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s61\",\"d7\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s62\",\"d7\",105,388,\"User: Absolutely! After attending a hands-on workshop focused on integrating traditional sounds with digital techniques, I’m now enrolled in an audio production workshop. The workshop was eye-opening, providing insights into how to use technology to enhance traditional music forms. \",\"user\",[70,71]],[\"s63\",\"d7\",388,780,\"I’m excited about the audio production course because it promises to deepen my technical knowledge and skills, especially in mixing and mastering. This new set of skills will allow me to bring my creative vision to life in ways I never thought possible. I truly believe that this journey will not only elevate my music but also connect me more deeply with the traditions I'm learning about.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[70,71]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"summary_revision_contracts\":{\"creative_history\":{\"previous_version\":1,\"eligible_route_ids\":[\"fact_57dffcae3d304232aa22a56d\"],\"required_source_ids\":[\"s27\",\"s4\",\"s28\",\"s16\",\"s36\",\"s17\",\"s38\",\"s48\",\"s37\",\"s18\",\"s46\",\"s5\",\"s19\",\"s15\",\"s7\",\"s3\",\"s47\",\"s6\"]}},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:6d150ad4c535a7d1e56c49b3ef96bb96c6ad1180a0c11c38c79fd844a3c7550b\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":173.0,\"observed_end\":175.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d2\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:aaffd3d364a21d460342e7babd8b5457280c15990c4562f7265fb84a3ced558a\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":37.0,\"observed_end\":39.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d3\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:e7a026a1e699694225904ac735e54f242d28ca85da0c2e3ea86daf04d7e3237a\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":43.0,\"observed_end\":44.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d4\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:21511e51837be40ac3d1edfc915fedc27a89763ce384e83cf91e475136a04e8d\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":107.0,\"observed_end\":108.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d5\":{\"doc_id\":\"pers